# Aromaticity perception, the axis where RDKit and OpenBabel most visibly
# disagree with each other. Disagreements here are findings, not failures.

c1ccccc1 benzene
c1ccncc1 pyridine
c1ccoc1 furan
c1ccsc1 thiophene
# Pyrrole lives in hard.smi; duplicating it here made nearest-neighbour ties
# arbitrary and the fingerprint report unreadable.
c1cnc[nH]1 imidazole
# Written Kekule; whether it comes back lowercase depends on perception.
C1=CC=CC=C1 benzene-kekule
# Aromatic ring fused to an aliphatic one.
C1CCc2ccccc2C1 tetralin
